    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Vampires Die</i></strong> is a turned based dice strategy game... taking your chances with the odds and using strategy to defeat rival clans, gaining reputation and moving up through the dark vampiric hierarchy in search of power, prestige and blood.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3590520/extras/103e6c468543c647086312e074bdad19.poster.avif?t=1745809124\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3590520/extras/103e6c468543c647086312e074bdad19.webm?t=1745809124\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3590520/extras/103e6c468543c647086312e074bdad19.mp4?t=1745809124\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Secretly hired by the &quot;Council&quot; to take out a rogue coven, you must gather your clan and travel through the dark streets, graveyards, sewers and crypts to battle against the deadliest of your own bloodline in this vampire dice board game.<br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3590520/extras/2e6b9b9d1ede865fd6b47815b74366e4.poster.avif?t=1745809124\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3590520/extras/2e6b9b9d1ede865fd6b47815b74366e4.webm?t=1745809124\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3590520/extras/2e6b9b9d1ede865fd6b47815b74366e4.mp4?t=1745809124\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Gather intel, search and explore, looking for the covens and clans sought by the &quot;Council&quot; - then roll the dice, gambling that your attributes will be strong enough to destroy the enemies that inhabit this dark underworld.\u00a0  <br><br>But remember... you must be careful, since there are ways that even\u00a0<i><strong>Vampires Die!</strong></i><br><br><br><strong>FEATURES:</strong>      <br>      <br>- Turn Based Strategy Style Gameplay        <br> - Top-Down Isometric View <br>- Haunting Soundtrack     <br>  - Fully Voiced Characters      <br>- Adjustable Difficulty      <br>      </p>",
