oy the enemies that inhabit this dark underworld.\u00a0  <br><br>But remember... you must be careful, since there are ways that even\u00a0<i><strong>Vampires Die!</strong></i><br><br><br><strong>FEATURES:</strong>      <br>      <br>- Turn Based Strategy Style Gameplay        <br> - Top-Down Isometric View <br>- Haunting Soundtrack     <br>  - Fully Voiced Characters      <br>- Adjustable Difficulty      <br>      </p>",
